open-bt-rig-interface — licensing overview

Copyright (c) 2026 Reid Crowe, N0RC

This repository contains hardware designs, firmware/software, and documentation,
each under its own license. The full license texts are in the LICENSES/ directory,
and per-file licensing follows the REUSE specification (SPDX headers and
REUSE.toml).

  hardware/ (KiCad designs, enclosure CAD)      CERN-OHL-P-2.0   LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt
  firmware/, tools/, protocol/ code, CI files   MIT              LICENSES/MIT.txt
  documentation (docs/, *.md)                   CC-BY-4.0        LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

Where a file carries its own SPDX-License-Identifier, that identifier governs
the file.
